# Everything here is optional. This server needs no credentials of its own —
# every read is relayed through the ContextMint Bridge browser extension running in
# your signed-in teams.cloud.microsoft tab.

# fetchproxy concentrator port. 37149 is the fleet-wide shared port the
# ContextMint Bridge extension dials — do not pick a "unique" one.
# TEAMS_WS_PORT=37149
